Cancel_Budgets_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when a call into Budgets is already running
│   └── it should revert with ReentrantCall
├── when the scheduled payment does not exist
│   └── it should revert with UnknownScheduled
├── when the caller is not authorised for the payment's budget
│   └── it should revert with NotAuthorised
├── when the payment is not Pending
│   ├── given it was cancelled
│   │   └── it should revert with NotPending
│   └── given it was paid
│       └── it should revert with NotPending
└── when the payment is Pending
    ├── it should subtract the amount from ownCommitted on the budget
    ├── it should subtract the amount from committed on the budget and every budget above it
    ├── it should mark the payment Cancelled
    ├── given the budget is closed
    │   └── it should still cancel
    ├── given its pay date has passed and no one has executed it
    │   └── it should still cancel
    ├── given the caller wears the hat of a budget above
    │   └── it should allow it
    └── it should emit ScheduleCancelled
